[al:新概念英语（二）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:She Was Not Amused]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:11.28]Why did Jenny want to leave the wedding reception? | 为什么珍妮想离开婚宴？
[00:16.80]Jeremy Hampden has a large circle of friends and is very popular at parties. | 杰里米·汉普登交际甚广，是聚会上深受大家欢迎的人。
[00:24.20]Everybody admires him for his great sense of humour--everybody, that is, except his six-year-old daughter, Jenny. | 人人都钦佩他那绝妙的幽默感——人人如此，除了他6岁的女儿珍妮。
[00:34.85]Recently, one of Jeremy's closest friends asked him to make a speech at a wedding reception. | 最近，杰里米最亲密的朋友之一请他在一个婚宴上讲话。
[00:43.10]This is the sort of thing that Jeremy loves. | 这正是杰里米喜欢做的事。
[00:47.35]He prepared the speech carefully and went to the wedding with Jenny. | 他认真准备了讲稿，带着珍妮一道去参加婚礼。
[00:52.84]He had included a large number of funny stories in the speech and, of course, it was a great success. | 他的讲稿里插入了大量有趣的故事，当然大获成功。
[01:01.52]As soon as he had finished Jenny told him she wanted to go home. | 他刚一讲完，珍妮就对他说她想回家。
[01:08.38]Jeremy was a little disappointed by this but he did as his daughter asked. | 这使杰里米有点失望，但他还是照女儿的话做了。
[01:14.98]On the way home, he asked Jenny if she had enjoyed the speech. | 回家的路上，他问珍妮是否喜欢他的讲话。
[01:21.03]To his surprise she said she hadn't. | 使他吃惊的是，她说不喜欢。
[01:25.10]Jeremy asked her why this was so and she told him that she did not like to see so many people laughing at him! | 杰里米问她为什么，她告诉他说她不愿意看到那么多人嘲笑他！
